        <rule name="Dig for Treasure" id="928d-8eef-c182-ed3d" hidden="false">
          <description>&quot;This Special Rule grants a chance to gain bonus Victory Points when claiming an objective&quot;

During the controlling player of this model&apos;s Victory Sub-Phase, if a model with this Special Rule controls an objective, add D3 to the total Victory points earned from controlling that objective.</description>
        </rule>
